he biggest takeaway from their  perspective was really the cultural  awareness so for me having spent half of  the program in singapore traveling to  lots of asian countries in southeast  asia spending several weeks in china for  instance the experiences that i did  there the cultural sensitivity that this  gave to me was really eye-opening for me  i took so much away from that and which  was a fundamental part of for my  personal learning experience that i had  during the mba so i hope you found this  insightful if you have any more  questions on what it's like to do an mba  please leave me a comment below in the  comments section once again if you want  to read more about the university of san  ganin and the mba link to the  information pages below in the video  description they're happy to reach out  to you provide you with all the  information that is needed again if you  took any value out of this video at all  please hit the like button for the  youtube algorithm and also very big  thanks to all the members of from  learning thanks for our support my name  is heinrich i'm the host here at from  learning i release videos every single  saturday so see you again next week  until then all the best and bye

